  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>In an ideal situation, doctors can take their time, but given your background and the immediate needs of your fellows, rushing right into it can save lives.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Dances class feature, know the cantering of the medicine man dance, Wis 12, primordial dancer level 6th</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may activate the knit sinew active ability of the cantering of the medicine man dance twice per day as a free action. You cannot activate the aforementioned ability more than once in a single round.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/primordial-dancer-feats#toc0\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
